- T. M. Cover and E. Ordentlich. Universal Portfolios with Side Information. _IEEE Transactions on Information Theory_, 42(2):348–363, 1996.
- A. Kalai and S. Vempala. Efficient Algorithms for Universal Portfolios. _Journal of Machine Learning Research_, 3:423–440, 2002.
